      "message": "I don\u0027t think this is the correct direction for the llndk libraries.\nIt does not make the llndk libs marked as llndk.\n\nDoes the llndk api library returns true for `m.IsLlndk()`? Otherwise, VNDK to api imported LLNDK may report link type check error. Please add a unit test for the dependency check from a VNDK library to an imported LLNDK library.\n\nInstead of making the api imported llndk modules to vendor available, they need to be marked as llndk libraries by setting `m.VendorProperties.IsLLNDK \u003d true` from the VndkMutator.",
